          ],
          "title": "FEUPer Wave",
          "summary": "A Tron-inspired, vapor-wave racing game built with Three.js. Every model was made in Blender.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "FEUPer Wave is a racing game built for the third assignment of SGI, where the goal was to develop a racing game with Three.js."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
